215 0 obj
<<
/A 868 0 R
/Alt (Infographic comparing current symptom-based psychiatry with precision psychiatry frameworks. Section A shows current care using diagnostic categories and symptom scales, highlighting that the same diagnosis can have different biology and outcomes. Section B presents a precision psychiatry approach integrating clinical, biological, and behavioral data through AI digital twin models to inform dynamic modeling, risk prediction, and individualized intervention design. Section C illustrates advanced biomaterials and bioelectronic tools, such as nanoparticles, hydrogels, and wearable sensors, aiming for biologically informed, patient-specific psychiatric interventions.)
/K [13 869 0 R]
/P 73 0 R
/Pg 37 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 1)
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
